+-- Ascension boss kits for dungeon bosses with a C++ script (CoADungeonBossKit.cpp runs them beside the script on
+-- Heroic/Mythic). Generated by dungeon-recherche/mechanik_sql.py: log kit plus every spell Exiles assigns to the boss
+-- that the script does not cast itself. event 0 timer / 2 health / 4 pull, target 1 self / 2 victim / 5 random,
+-- cast_flags 1 interrupt / 2 triggered / 0x20 only if the aura is missing, base_points = effect 0 override.
